<img src="https://fileserver.developer.huaweicloud.com/FileServer/getFile/spaceguides/000/fe8/1fa/09329602ec000fe81faac006ed7069fa.20250627024712.54438524724511382491561487189840:50560626024713:2421:82226FEA5FB0C4B21A63C1F758FB93A19576070AD8E73217D40C949A6624D8AF.png?customIdMd=9141ba2ba3fc41a4b7652b968f46a7ab"  width=80% />
<br>

2. 在组件模板列表中，单击`widgetVue3Template`，进入模板详情页。

<img src="https://fileserver.developer.huaweicloud.com/FileServer/getFile/spaceguides/000/fe8/1fa/09329602ec000fe81faac006ed7069fa.20250627024714.60398833792603154471021508257806:50560626024715:2421:9FAF892847176A1935A11E70C2A4BC547BD9D107AF71F273F85D255C25CA8ADB.png?customIdMd=35ce2d47aff44cbc8ba4dc9b156c3757"  width=80% />
