3. 单击**下载**，设置组件的名称为`userLogin`，单击**保存**，将模板下载到本地。

<img src="https://fileserver.developer.huaweicloud.com/FileServer/getFile/spaceguides/000/fe8/1fa/09329602ec000fe81faac006ed7069fa.20250627024716.90484933159250774074453477783045:50560626024717:2421:E4557B6436920194BD8A8BB655109F62BA50E13148CC0C0AC001D6670AD81374.png?customIdMd=26898396ea2348488359c638b7a104f4"  width=80% />
