4. 下载完成后，查看解压后的组件目录。

<img src="https://fileserver.developer.huaweicloud.com/FileServer/getFile/spaceguides/000/fe8/1fa/09329602ec000fe81faac006ed7069fa.20250627024717.48861973001020885283212925525591:50560626024718:2421:2F33B92B3663FE80E1454D7A9D5625C7513891703BFADA6CC21DDCA795275995.png?customIdMd=bf8220cf680c441b8d498997d75c05ff"  width=80% />

